    "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:39:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-05T13:39:30Z",
    "body": "I don't think I agree with this change. Perhaps I could be persuaded that `b` and `strong` are equivalent, but the guidance here is about a much broader set of elements. And people definitely abuse `<p><b>` as a heading and should not.",
