    "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:18:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-19T11:18:02Z",
    "body": "Yeah, the spec text here seems generally helpful to nudge developers to use the appropriate element. Maybe it could be made more general and moved to the requirement I quoted above. That people disagree with what the spec says doesn't seem like a good reason to remove text from the spec.",
